## 📡 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/health` | Service health check |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/rag/ingest` | Ingest raw text or documents into the vector store |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/rag/query` | Ask questions with context retrieval & source citations |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/rag/chat-stream` | Stream LLM answer tokens via SSE (`text/event-stream`) |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/rag/stats` | View total vectors and collection details |

